any time during the battle to destroy your rivals and show them who's boss.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Good online experience guaranteed:</strong> Online servers powered by Hybrid Rollback Netcode and Private Dedicated Servers. This means that you will be able to destroy and outsmart naive stickmans across the world.<br><br><strong>\u2022 Easy control scheme:</strong> The classic fighting games prevent you from doing it cool combos with excessively difficult controls, that's why in this game all the controls are easy to learn, \u00a1In the whole game theres no one Motion-Input!",
